 0. Client would need to wait for master leader get heartbeats from tserver.\r\n        at org.yb.pgsql.TestPgBatch.setUpTable(TestPgBatch.java:63)\r\n        at org.yb.pgsql.TestPgBatch.testTransparentRestartHelper(TestPgBatch.java:93)\r\n        at org.yb.pgsql.TestPgBatch.testTransparentRestartFirstStatement(TestPgBatch.java:188)\r\n\r\n[ERROR] testSyncInLongBatch(org.yb.pgsql.TestPgBatch)  Time elapsed: 0.216 s  <<< ERROR!\r\ncom.yugabyte.util.PSQLException: ERROR: Invalid table definition: Error creating table yugabyte.t on the master: num_tablets should be greater than 0. Client would need to wait for master leader get heartbeats from tserver.\r\n        at org.yb.pgsql.TestPgBatch.setUpTable(TestPgBatch.java:63)\r\n        at org.yb.pgsql.TestPgBatch.testSyncInLongBatchHelper(TestPgBatch.java:198)\r\n        at org.yb.pgsql.TestPgBatch.testSyncInLongBatch(TestPgBatch.java:248)\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut running them individually works fine.\r\n\r\n`./yb_build.sh fastdebug --gcc11 --java-test 'TestPgBatch#testSyncInLongBatchRcCornerCase'`\r\n\r\nTested on master 0d1046abdbd832ea51c7a03dc763ad03737d3ba8 and pg15.\r\n\r\nSee similar #22247.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/failing-test\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-13052]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13052?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"foucher","id":6496319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTYzMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6496319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/foucher","html_url":"https://github.com/foucher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foucher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foucher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foucher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.gith